/span>: What did you tell her?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I told her I thought it was a good idea to take some courses and get some freelance experience. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Do you think it is difficult for someone who wants to start working in journalism to break into the field?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It can be tough. In my opinion, it's important to get experience. I told her she could write articles for <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "52500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How challenging do you think it is for a new journalist to find stories that appeal to a wide audience?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't think it's very difficult. You have to engage with people and listen to their comments.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She could write about the dangers of running on a soccer field in the spring!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK, good idea!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le15ob04re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}